    <div class="tab-container">
        
            <div id="cite-apa" class="tab selected" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-0" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_apa rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_apa rendering_contributiontojournal_apa"><a rel="Person" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/persons/matthew.paterson/" class="link"><span>Paterson, M.</span></a><a rel="Person" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/persons/paul.tobin/" class="link"><span>, Tobin, P.</span></a>, &amp; VanDeveer, S. D. (2022). <a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/publications/climate-governance-antagonisms-policy-stability-and-repoliticizat/" class="link"><span>Climate Governance Antagonisms: Policy Stability and Repoliticization</span></a>. <span><em>Global Environmental Politics</em></span>. <a onclick="window.open(this.href, '_blank','noopener,noreferrer'); return false;" href="https://doi.org/10.1162/glep_a_00647" class="link"><span>https://doi.org/10.1162/glep_a_00647</span></a></div>
